          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP381 R.A.M. -(Royal Alberta Museum)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Walked to this one from my last cap find along the road up the hill.  It was a fairly quick find after looking at the previous context pics and noticing the slight indent in the ground.  Just had to throw off a few leaves and there it was.  Grabbed a pic and then decided to cut through, head down the hill and walk back to parking along the trail.  Gorgeous morning for a walk in the park....and a few walks in a few parks.  :)  TFTBC OFTH....and the adventure.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
